# Saga Drift (CIPlay saga_drift): the gangway, the charter, the screechers, the smelter yard, the council minutes, the
# rats, the rendering house, the chapel keypad (1909) and strongbox, the winch locker, the last sermon.
island Saga Drift
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Floating City
zone gangway
expect step 1
read City charter
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect step 3
open Smelter yard chest
wait 3
expect step 4
read Council cabin minutes
expect step 5
zone council
kill Rat
expect step 6
open Rendering house chest
wait 3
expect step 7
code chapelpad 1909
expect story chapelcode 1
open Chapel strongbox
wait 3
expect step 8
expect hidden anchorchest
use anchorwinch
expect story winchfree 0
use bell1
use bell2
use bell3
expect story bellrung 3
expect step 9
use anchorwinch
expect story bellrung 0
expect shown anchorchest
expect step 10
open Winch locker
wait 3
expect step 11
read Last sermon
expect done
